actions.supported_help = Kuqotshwa imilayo yokukhetha eqediweyo, ukudala/ukuphinda/ukwenza i-raster/ukuhlanganisa izendlalelo, ukugcwalisa ngombala wangaphambili/owangemuva, Ukufiphalisa kwe-Gaussian/Ngebhokisi/Ngokunyakaza, Ukulola, Isimbozo Sokulola, Inani Eliphakathi, lokulungisa.
